('me-tech-more', 'eng-mechanical', 5, 'Technical Electives: remaining hours (12 credit hours in all)', 'choose_credits', null, 6, 3, '^(MECHENG|AEROENG|NUCLREN) 5\d{3}', array['MECHENG 5600', 'MECHENG 5193']::text[], 'Any 5000-level MECHENG, AEROENG, or NUCLREN course, plus at most 3 credit hours from professional skills, independent study, other 5000-level engineering courses (BIOMEDE, CBE, CIVILEN, CSE, ECE, ENVENG, FABENG, ISE, MATSCEN, WELDENG...), CHEM 2310+, MATH 4000+, PHYSICS 5000+, or STAT 4201+. Research tracks (honors and non-honors) follow different rules. Source: https://mae.osu.edu/undergraduate/mechanical-engineering-0/mechanical-engineering-technical-electives', null),
